## Summary
The president of Broward College has agreed to step down from their position. The announcement was reported by Inside Higher Ed on August 25, 2026, with the article authored by Josh Moody.

## Key Points
- Broward College is experiencing a change in leadership as its president steps down.
- The news was published on Inside Higher Ed, highlighting its relevance in the higher education sector.
- The step-down agreement indicates a planned transition rather than an abrupt departure.
- The article was written by journalist Josh Moody, providing coverage of the event.


